# Optional — not required for public installs

`@folklore-digital/architecture-kit` is published to the **public npm registry**. Hosts should install with:

```bash
npm install -D @folklore-digital/architecture-kit
```

No `.npmrc` scope or GitHub token is needed for this package.

Only add a GitHub Packages `.npmrc` if you still consume **other** private `@folklore-digital/*` packages from `npm.pkg.github.com`.
